// Stress 16: PM-authored scenario rendered back as prose and sequence
//
// EXPECTED FINDINGS
//   `grimble show --prose checkout` yields one sentence per arm: "If payment is declined, retry up to 3 times, then fail with declined"
//   Sequence diagram: one alt per handled non-ok arm; round trip of prose edit is NOT supported (read-only)
